      "biography": {
        "value": "<p><em>Waluipedia cast sheet — King K. Rool.</em> Built by <code>tools/build-character-sheets.py</code>, hand-authored from the article. XP ledger: level 1, power rating 4 → a level 1 Fighter player-character sheet (a player may take this seat; the authored CR 1 stands in where the ledger is silent). Numbers are a GM-ready reading of the record, not a filed stat line; the article stays the authority. Archive date 1040 BF.</p><p><strong>The Crocodile Who Won't Stay Down</strong> — Kremling Krew</p><p>Status: Active — commanding Kremling operations from Crocodile Isle</p><p>King K. Rool is the leader of the Kremlings and either a strategic genius or a complete lunatic—Waluigi genuinely cannot tell which, and suspects the answer might be 'both.' He changes personas constantly—pirate, scientist, boxer, king—like he's testing which version of himself works best against current enemies. He's been defeated by DK and friends more times than Waluigi can count, yet keeps coming back with new schemes, new costumes, and the same unsettling energy. Waluigi finds him exhausting to think about.</p><h3>Evidence</h3><ul><li><strong>Crown Toss</strong> — “King K. Rool is the leader of the Kremlings and either a strategic genius or a complete lunatic—Waluigi genuinely cannot tell which, and suspects the answer might be 'both.' He changes personas constantly—pirate”</li><li><strong>Belly Slam</strong> — “King K. Rool is the leader of the Kremlings and either a strategic genius or a complete lunatic—Waluigi genuinely cannot tell which, and suspects the answer might be 'both.' He changes personas constantly—pirate”</li><li><strong>Won't Stay Down</strong> — “King K. Rool is the leader of the Kremlings and either a strategic genius or a complete lunatic—Waluigi genuinely cannot tell which, and suspects the answer might be 'both.' He changes personas constantly—pirate”</li><li><strong>Kremling Intelligence</strong> — “At the Second Diplomatic Summit, K. Rool demonstrated that beneath the costume changes and theatrical villainy, the Kremlings are capable of sophisticated intelligence operations.”</li></ul><p>Article: <code>#/article/king_k_rool</code> (characters). Site sheet: <code>#/sheets/king_k_rool</code>.</p>",
        "public": ""
      }
